course: dictionary
lesson: 15590
title: Tabby: a cat with a pattern
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A tabby is a cat, and it is also a pattern. Read the words around it to find out which one it is. «Our tabby cat, Biscuit, loves to nap on the warm windowsill.» Here tabby is the kind of cat Biscuit is.
explain: Look at the words that describe the cat's coat. «The kitten has a tabby coat, with stripes all over its back.» Stripes tell you that tabby is about the pattern on the fur. It is not about the size or the colour alone.
explain: Tabby can also be a describing word, like striped or spotted. «The tabby kitten chased a ball of wool.» Ask yourself: does the sentence need a thing or a describing word? Here tabby sits before kitten, so it describes the kitten.
explain: Some words have an old meaning too. In old books you may read that a tabby is a female cat. Today people rarely use it that way, so check the other words in the story to see which meaning fits.
fact: A tabby is a cat with a striped, swirled or spotted coat.
fact: Tabby cats are often grey, brown or ginger, and many have an «M» shape on their forehead.
fact: Tabby is also a describing word: «a tabby kitten» means a kitten with that striped pattern.
fact: Tabby describes a coat pattern, not a breed of cat. Many different cats can be tabby.
fact: The old meaning, «a female cat», is rare today, so use the clues in the sentence to decide.
exercise: «Our tabby cat, Biscuit, loves to nap on the warm windowsill.» What is a tabby? | A bird that can sing | A dog with a short tail | A fish with orange scales | *A cat with a striped, swirled or spotted coat
exercise: «The kitten has a tabby coat, with stripes all over its back.» What does tabby describe here? | The kitten's age | *The striped pattern of its coat | The colour of its eyes | The size of its paws
exercise: Mia says, «My ginger tabby has an M on her forehead.» What does the M shape tell you? | The cat is very old | The cat is called M | The cat is a dog | *The cat has a tabby pattern, marked on its forehead
test: «A silver tabby sat in the sun.» What is a silver tabby? | *A tabby cat with a grey coat | A silver spoon | A tabby cat with silver-grey stripes | A fast running dog
test: Is tabby a breed of cat? | Yes, it is the only kind of cat | *No, it is a coat pattern that many cats can have | No, it is a kind of fish | Yes, it is a special breed from far away
exam: «In an old book, the tabby came in to be fed.» What does tabby mean here? | A striped kitten's toy | A dog | *A female cat | A kind of bird
